Hello all,

1) The idea of losing the amout of hitpoints as your polymorphed form is
   hip!
2) No restrictions say I for what monsters have what wands but the idea
   that some stupider guys don't know what all the stuff is a hip concept.
3) More monsters, especially higher level, should have random artifacts!
4) As opposed to simply intrinsic time outs, things like poison and magic
   shouldn't be 100%.  Also if time outs are a possibility, have folk al-
   ready in Hell that lose fire resisitance gradually lose their hps.
5) Have more high level monsters with nasty attacks!  The game still
   seems weighted toward the old rogue/hack where 14th was the top, be-
   sides the Quest Big Baddies where are all the other 14 plus HD folk?
6) Put a cap on unworldly AC!  Once you get your AC under -25, you're 
   untouchable.  I myself have modified my code so the damage reduction
   of AC under -15 is treated as -15!
                                   
